WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,910 --> 00:00:02,910
This is how I was taught this craft

2
00:00:02,910 --> 00:00:05,200
We've been neighbors for so long

3
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:06,200
I don’t sell buns

4
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:08,260
I'm afraid you'll steal my business

5
00:00:08,260 --> 00:00:10,360
It can really save the store.

6
00:00:10,360 --> 00:00:23,590
Yes, I will definitely remember your love

7
00:00:23,590 --> 00:00:24,590
Why did it collapse?

8
00:00:24,590 --> 00:00:25,590
Not awake enough

9
00:00:25,590 --> 00:00:29,800
Don't be in a hurry to put it on the pot again

10
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:30,800
Something is wrong this time

11
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:31,800
Kneading the dough too hard

12
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:34,140
Don’t make the rod skin so thick either.

13
00:00:34,140 --> 00:00:35,140
Much better than before

14
00:00:35,140 --> 00:00:36,140
Adjust the filling again

15
00:00:36,140 --> 00:00:37,140
The heat is a bit worse too

16
00:00:38,590 --> 00:00:40,420
Still want to eat

17
00:00:40,420 --> 00:00:42,420
How many have you eaten in the afternoon?
